      "quote": "B.8\nSIGNIFICANCE TEST\nStatistical significance is a key factor in evaluating model performance. To assess this, we conducted\npairwise t-tests on select datasets where we had access to both ToG-2 and baseline results. However,\nmany of the baseline results reported in Table 1 were directly cited from their respective original\npapers or other related works. As a result, we do not have access to the detailed outputs of these\nbaseline models for individual questions, preventing us from performing significance tests on those\nbaselines at this time.\nFor the WebQSP, Zero-Shot-RE, QALD-10-en, and Creak datasets, we computed pairwise t-tests\ncomparing ToG-2 with CoK and ToG as in Table 12.\n(ToG-2 vs. ) Method\nWebQSP\nZero-Shot-RE\nQALD-10-en\nCreak\nCoK\np < 0.05\np < 0.01\np < 0.05\np < 0.05\nToG\np < 0.05\np < 0.05\np < 0.05\np > 0.9",
